nspected: matching title/author and exact edition source. Language established bibliographically, never from jacket alone."},{"reviewNote":"ISBN9789025852511 and parentOL26376875W identify book7, originally2008. Cover large7 and library corroborate. Edition title becomes De Griezelbus7; Work identity/firstyear and collection links remain unchanged. Do not classify as series entry book."}],"work_id":1131,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":672,"text":"Onnoval wordt op een vollemaannacht ontvoerd door de Griezelbus en belandt tussen de geheimzinnige Reizigers. Terwijl hij verzwakt raakt, dringen herinneringen en dreigende stemmen uit een andere werkelijkheid tot hem door. Liselore vermoedt dat er iets ernstig mis is en zoekt met anderen naar hem. Dit zevende deel onderzoekt Onnovals verleden en brengt zijn verbondenheid met de bus verder aan het licht.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bibliotheek.nl","source_url":"https://www.bibliotheek.nl/catalogus/titel.322278295.html/de-griezelbus/","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789045020846","key":{"id":1148},"before":{"id":1148,"title":"Reizen zonder John","isbn_10":null,"isbn_13":"9789045020846","work_id":1148,"language":null,"publisher":"Uitgeverij Atlas Contact","created_at":"2026-09-03T19:11:44.963193+00:00","open_library_edition_id":"OL31069297M"},"after":{"id":1148,"title":"Reizen zonder John","isbn_10":null,"isbn_13":"9789045020846","work_id":1148,"language":"nld","publisher":"Uitgeverij Atlas Contact","created_at":"2026-09-03T19:11:44.963193+00:00","open_library_edition_id":"OL31069297M"}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789045020846","key":{"edition_id":1148},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-10-31T20:50:00Z","review_batch":"nl-followup-004-20261031","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/69197/reizen-zonder-john.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Reviewed content for original Du