3599_Grote_verwachtingen_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T20:22:26.917Z","http":200,"sha256":"cfeeb4c4c60cb295e2812bf0a693c518405d37a94869f64a7a34f4c3f853626d","bytes":453350,"fact":"Full source image decoded and inspected: matching title/author and exact edition source. Language established bibliographically, never from jacket alone."},{"reviewNote":"Shared modern blurb mentions COVID, which does not belong to the proposed2019 print. Own summary excludes the later-added event."}],"work_id":1149,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":677,"text":"Geert Mak beschrijft de Europese geschiedenis vanaf de eeuwwisseling en onderzoekt hoe aanvankelijk optimisme plaatsmaakt voor onzekerheid. De euro, veranderende verhoudingen met Rusland, de financiële crisis en migratie vormen belangrijke lijnen in zijn verhaal. Hij verbindt politieke ontwikkelingen met de stemming onder inwoners van het continent. Het boek vraagt wat er terechtkwam van de verwachtingen waarmee Europa de nieuwe eeuw binnenging.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1183197/grote-verwachtingen.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789048868001","key":{"isbn_13":"9789048868001"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":1155,"title":"Jagtlust","isbn_13":"9789048868001","isbn_10":"9048868009","language":"nld","publisher":"Overamstel Uitgevers","open_library_edition_id":null}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789048868001","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789048868001"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-10-31T20:50:00Z","review_batch":"nl-followup-004-20261031","evidence":[{"url":"https://www.annejetvanderzijl.com/boek/2387/annejet-van-der-zijl-jagtlust.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Reviewed content for original Dutch summary; not a copied publisher blurb"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/264085/jagtlust.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T20:32:3